WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
[Music]

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.700
[On screen: Can a 258 lb dad run a sub-3
marathon?]

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:17.160
Rook: His watch has him at a four thirty-nine
marathon.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:18.200
Rook: Day one.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:21.320
Rook: Chicago needs a two fifty-nine.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.480
Rook: An hour forty short.

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:24.680
Rook: Get them up.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:26.600
Kai: Hills every week.

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:29.720
Kai: Easy days slower than his ego wants.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.360
Bo: I want his legs twice a week.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:37.560
Kai: Not the day before my hard runs.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:38.360
Bo: Fine.

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:39.560
Bo: Same day.

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:41.560
Bo: After you are done with him.

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:46.920
Juno: I feed him first.

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:50.520
Mo: And I keep him in one piece.

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:56.900
Kai: That’s every morning till October.

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:57.920
Rook: He asked.

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:01.100
[On screen: Not yet. Shoes on.]

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:03.400
Kai: Easy.

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:05.080
Kai: Easier than that.
